    "detailed_description": "The original release of \u201cWhat's your gender\u201d was our entry and the winner to the \u201cBinary and Beyond\u201d themed BPB game jam. Since then a couple of updates have added content, english language support and rounded out the game. Additionally the Steam release has a couple of achievements to hunt.<br><br>It is an Antichamber inspired educational puzzle game, that allows you to simultaneously explore a non-euclidean maze and concepts and terms related to gender, identity and expression in a playful and reassuring manner. The game is currently available fully voiced in English and German.<br><br><strong>NOTE:</strong> This is a short game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> WASD or Arrow keys + Mouse to move<br></li><li> Space to jump (optional)<br></li><li> E/LMB to interact</li></ul>",
